VYRA — Third-Party Notices
==========================

This file lists third-party material redistributed as part of this repository, together with the
credit its licence requires. It covers the redistributed *files*; the matching in-app credit shown
to people who see the work is rendered by apps/mobile/src/components/ModelCredit.tsx, and the
machine-readable source of truth for both is apps/mobile/src/lib/attribution.ts. Update all three
together.

Every runtime character in apps/mobile/assets/characters/ is a *derivative* of a third-party model:
the five evolution stages in each family are localized physique deformations of a supplied source
mesh, not original artwork. A derivative carries the original licence, so each family below owes its
author credit. The per-family modification notice lives in that directory's SOURCE.md, and each
output GLB keeps the author/source/licence fields embedded in its own glTF `asset.extras` metadata —
do not strip that metadata when processing or re-exporting an asset.


