Portrait card art
-----------------

The `card.png` beside each family's GLBs is a Blender render of that family's Starter model, cropped
by scripts/character-assets.mjs. A render of a CC BY 4.0 model is itself a derivative of that model,
so each card carries the credit listed for its family above.


Original VYRA assets
--------------------

The five evolution-stage character models (`starter.glb`, `developing.glb`, `strong.glb`,
`elite.glb`, `legendary.glb` in apps/mobile/assets/heroes/) are original VYRA procedural artwork
generated by scripts/generate-heroes.mjs. Their provenance is recorded per-asset in
apps/mobile/assets/heroes/manifest.json. They predate the assets/characters/ pipeline and are no
longer what the app loads at runtime; they need no third-party credit.
